dist/
node_modules/

# The extracted Camoufox browser (~1.2GB) the Dockerfile COPYs into the image.
# Deliberately not in git: it is a build input fetched from a GitHub release,
# not source. camoufox-js can fetch it itself at build time -- this directory
# only exists because that download has no resume support and kept failing
# mid-transfer on an unstable connection. See the Dockerfile comment above the
# COPY for how to regenerate it (fetch the release zip, extract here, write
# version.json).
.camoufox-prefetched/
